{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#card-zh","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Context Mode Adapter 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的上下文管理插件，通过宿主工具注册接口接入 context-mode 的 ctx 工具，并在工具执行、会话步进和压缩事件上挂接路由与记忆逻辑。它可注册沙箱执行、文件分析、检索和索引等工具，拦截部分工具调用并注入路由提示，也会在压缩前保存会话快照、后续恢复上下文。设置卡展示依赖状态并提供逐项工具开关，适合希望减少长会话上下文负担的 DSH 用户。使用前需在本机安装 context-mode。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-380","lib/index.js:500-534","lib/index.js:1625-1708","lib/client.js:144-150"]}
{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#card-en","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Context Mode Adapter connects context-mode tools and routing to DSH. It registers sandbox, file analysis, search, and indexing tools, injects guidance, and saves session snapshots before compaction. Its settings card shows dependency status and tool switches. Install context-mode locally first.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-380","lib/index.js:500-534","lib/index.js:1625-1708","lib/client.js:144-150"]}
