{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#feature-1","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Context Mode Adapter 的功能「进程内工具注册」：把 context-mode 注册表中的工具适配为 DSH 工具并按开关注册。工具可执行沙箱命令、分析文件或检索索引内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-380","lib/index.js:500-534"]}
{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#feature-2","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Context Mode Adapter 的功能「工具路由」：每次工具调用时运行路由判断，可继续、修改参数、阻止调用或附加上下文；在 DSH 工具执行事件中触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:70-108","lib/index.js:1625-1646"]}
{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#feature-3","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Context Mode Adapter 的功能「会话压缩续接」：压缩开始时保存会话快照，后续会话步进时领取快照并注入恢复内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1655-1708"]}
{"unit_id":"sadjjk__dsh-context-mode-adapter#feature-4","repo":"sadjjk/dsh-context-mode-adapter","commit":"270cca3038af5c5fc0e6ada34dc535123bbac60c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Context Mode Adapter 的功能「工具与路由设置卡」：在插件配置界面显示依赖状态、逐项启停工具，并调整重复注入检测窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:100-143","lib/client.js:300-390"]}
